  <dc:creator>VideoLAN</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>LibVLC is a modular multimedia framework that can render video and output audio as well as encode and stream. 
As it is native code, you will need to use a wrapper library such as LibVLCSharp to use it from .NET.</dc:description>
